Troubleshooting:-

a) Problem 1: YAML Syntax Error

Initially, I had:

vars:-

This is incorrect.

Correct:

vars:

=> Lesson:-

YAML indentation and syntax are very important in Ansible.

b) Problem 2: Incorrect key_name indentation

I also had:

-key_name: "{{ key_name }}"

This is incorrect.

Correct:

key_name: "{{ key_name }}"

=> Also, module parameters need proper indentation:

amazon.aws.ec2_instance:
  name:
  key_name:
  instance_type:

key_name: "{{ key_name }}"

